WEBVTT

37:30.775 --> 37:32.944
Yes, Khaleesi.

37:35.363 --> 37:38.157
- Why did you hit her?!
- How many times do I have to tell you?

37:38.282 --> 37:42.036
- You do not command me.
- I wasn't commanding you.

37:42.161 --> 37:43.746
I just wanted to invite you to supper.

37:43.871 --> 37:45.998
- What's this?
- It's a gift.

37:46.123 --> 37:48.751
- I had it made for you.
- Dothraki rags?

37:48.876 --> 37:50.670
- Are you going to dress me now?
- Please.

37:50.795 --> 37:53.214
This stinks of manure. All of it.

37:53.339 --> 37:55.216
Stop. Stop. Stop it.

37:55.341 --> 37:57.802
You would turn me
into one of them, wouldn't you?

37:57.927 --> 38:00.555
- Next you'll want to braid my hair.
- You've no right to a braid.
